<h2>Your Diet Plan Has Been Assigned</h2>

<p>Dear <%= memberName %>,</p>

<p>Great news! Your personalized diet plan has been assigned and is now ready for you to view.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Diet Plan Details</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Plan Name:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><%= planName %></td>
    </tr>
    <% if (nutritionistName) { %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Assigned By:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><%= nutritionistName %></td>
    </tr>
    <% } %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Assigned Date:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><%= assignedDate %></td>
    </tr>
    <% if (planDuration) { %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0;"><strong>Duration:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0;"><%= planDuration %></td>
    </tr>
    <% } %>
  </table>
</div>

<% if (planUrl) { %>
<p>
  <a href="<%= planUrl %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: <%= franchise.brandColor || '#4CAF50' %>; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0;">
    View Your Diet Plan
  </a>
</p>
<% } %>

<p>Your diet plan has been carefully crafted based on your health goals and preferences. Make sure to follow it consistently for the best results.</p>

<p>If you have any questions or need to make adjustments to your plan, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:<%= franchise.supportEmail %>"><%= franchise.supportEmail %></a>.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>The <%= franchise.franchiseName %> Team</p>

